# Who must approve what. Replace the placeholders; then in branch protection for `main` require:
# review from code owners, the `gate` status check, and dismissal of stale approvals on new commits.
# The protected set (H5) — one owner set, never the implementer role.
/AGENTS.md             @OWNER
/policy.mk             @OWNER
/tests/MOCK_ALLOWLIST  @OWNER
/docs/agents-policy.md @OWNER
/Makefile              @OWNER
/scripts/              @OWNER
/.claude/              @OWNER
/.github/              @OWNER
/.gate/                @OWNER
# Source needs the verifier role's approval; the implementer role's token must not be able to approve.
/src/                  @VERIFY-BOT
